      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You can't see PC avatars because:\n1. They are in a different format: PC for PCVR and Android for Quest.\n2. The quest can't handle most PC avatars and shaders.\nIt won't be done because it's just not possible currently.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
