      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's not as simple as checking a box to allow Quest users to see PC content. It's an entirely different platform; everything is literally in a different format that the platform simply can't read. That's just how it works. If a Quest user wants to see PC content, then the creator of that content must compile it for Android and cut it down to be within the spec of the Quest limitations and upload it. That's just how it is.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
