      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a95256f54d514123c1f089d|full_name}\n\nThis is 4 years old so I apologize, but now the Quest is more than capable of handling PC shaders and such. And you can't know if they'll be bad for Quest or not because Quest only has like 6 whitelisted shaders. Can't know if a Shader is optimized on Quest if it's not allowed to run on quest.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
