  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-01-07T22:59:40.581Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There should just be an option on quest in settings to show or hide PC only avatars (With a warning that PC avatars might negatively affect performance) or possibly a slider to set max graphics shown on PC avatars. A lot of PC avatars can actually work fine on Quest but since they were published as PC only, Quest players can't see or use them. Some are literally 2d or just a simple shape like a cube and would work perfectly fine on the Quest. A LOT of people are waiting for this. Please consider and add it soon. Thanks.",
